Package: ISPAT
Type: Package
Title: Informed Spatially Aware Patterns for Multiplexed Immunofluorescence Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sagnik", "Bhadury", email = "bhadury@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits a Bayesian spatial mixed-effects model to each marker of a
    multiplexed immunofluorescence (mIF) tissue image, de-spatialises the
    resulting marker expression, and recovers shared and region-specific
    cell-type interaction networks via a multi-study factor analysis of the
    de-spatialised residuals. Supports RBF and Matern spatial covariance
    kernels and both full Bayesian sampling and variational inference for the
    per-marker spatial fit, and CAVI or SVI variational algorithms for the
    factor model. Methods and application described in Bhadury et al. (2026)
    <https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-026-35341-8>.
